{
  "$description": "Stemma's design tokens, in the Design Tokens Community Group format. Deep blue identifies the product and its navigation; cool paper-like surfaces hold the work. Serif is reserved for mathematics and signed prose, grotesk for interface language and mono for verbatim material. Only three colours carry meaning: a human commitment (ditto), a machine proof (verified) and a refutation (refuted). The first level of every path is its category; the rest is the token's name.",
